  "interpretation": "V52's development-only one-call gain did not generalize. On frozen project-fresh data it reduced exact calls, increased false actions, and regressed the prespecified cross-target family. Exact target mentions remain useful as auditable perception data, but the 4B model cannot be trusted to infer all six discourse states from this prompt representation.",
